OPTION 1) Debian (apt)
  - Install system packages:

sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y pip pipx git tmux curl wget build-essential libssl-dev libffi-dev
    
    sudo apt install python3-setuptools
    sudo apt install python3-wheel  
    sudo apt install python3-requests 
    sudo apt install python3-numpy 
    sudo apt install python3-pandas

  paste the machine into a nano file and run using the command python <file name>

